        <mxCell id="card_enums" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF2FF;strokeColor=#C7D2FE;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=14;arcSize=8;shadow=1;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;font-size: 14.5px; color: #1E1B4B;&#39;&gt;Prisma Enums &amp;amp; Strict Type Safety&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 8px;&#39;&gt;&lt;span style=&#39;color: #4338CA;&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;enum AnomalySeverity {&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;CRITICAL, HIGH, WARNING }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&#39;color: #047857;&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;enum AlertStatus {&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ACTIVE, ACKNOWLEDGED, RESOLVED }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&#39;color: #B45309;&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;enum HealthStatus {&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;HEALTHY, DEGRADED, DOWN }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;font-size: 11.5px; color: #334155; margin-top: 6px; line-height: 1.4;&#39;&gt;• End-to-end TypeScript types generated via Prisma Client.&lt;br/&gt;• Zero &lt;code&gt;any&lt;/code&gt; types across ingestion and triage pipelines.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="330" width="365" y="482" as="geometry" />
