        <mxCell id="card_governance" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#A7F3D0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=12;spacingRight=14;arcSize=8;shadow=1;" value="&lt;b style=&#39;font-size: 14.5px; color: #064E3B;&#39;&gt;ACID Integrity, SRE Audit &amp;amp; Dedup Shield&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style=&#39;font-size: 12px; color: #064E3B; line-height: 1.55; margin-top: 8px;&#39;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Foreign Key Cascade Safety:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;code&gt;onDelete: Cascade&lt;/code&gt; ensures test endpoints clean up cleanly.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Immutable SRE Audit Trail:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Every resolve via &lt;b&gt;PATCH /alerts/:id/resolve&lt;/b&gt; records operator notes &amp;amp; calculates MTTR duration.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Nodemailer Dedup Shield:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;code&gt;email_dispatched: Boolean&lt;/code&gt; prevents duplicate email spam.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
